# Exit asks "before Quill closes?" when there are unsaved changes; Cancel keeps the document, Yes saves it and quits.
@copy plain.qld
cmd Open
expect file Open
choose "PLAIN.QLD"
type "x"
cmd Exit
expect ask "Save the changes to PLAIN.QLD before Quill closes?" default Yes
cancel
dump
cmd Exit
expect ask "Save the changes to PLAIN.QLD before Quill closes?" default Yes
answer Yes
dump
